      "finding_id": "plain:authz:1",
      "cwe_id": "CWE-862",
      "explanation": "This PR adds explicit object-level permission checks (has_perm with the provider as the object) to every handler in StreamView, StreamVerifyView, and StreamStatusView \u2014 GET, POST, PATCH, PUT, DELETE. Previously these handlers lacked such checks (CWE-862). The fix is consistent across all methods and the accompanying tests verify that a user without the 'add_stream' permission receives a 403. No remaining unguarded paths are visible in the diff.",
